1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Temaşevanên me yê hêja, temaşevanên me yê ezîz, delalo,
nazdar û bedewano,
 
Our dear viewers, our beloved, precious, sweet, and
beautiful viewers,

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Ez bi hêvî me hûn gîd di nav xêr û xweşiyê da bin,
 
I hope you are all in goodness and happiness,

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
bi silav û rêz jiyana we hebe.
 
may you have a life with greetings and respect.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Bi rastî qenela Hatim Efrîn carek din derbasî gundê Hesen
dibe.
 
Indeed, Hatim Afrin's channel is visiting the village of
Hasan once again.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Îşella em bi hêvî ne em ê ji we ra sos bikin,
 
God willing, we hope to present something to you,

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,000
