we will come again,

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:29,000
li ser dîroka gundnas bikin, li cem bav û kalên xwe rûnin,
cem kesên temenê xwe mezin, cem mezinên xwe em ê rûnin,
 
to discover the village's history, sit with our fathers and
grandfathers, sit with our elders,

8
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:31,000
em ê gel wan dîroka gund nas bikin.
 
we will get to know the history of the village with them.

9
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Lê îro jî em ê bi hev ra derbasî cem xortekî û keçikekê bin,
wan gundê Hesen nas bikin.
 
But today we will visit a young boy and a girl, and get to
know them in the village of Hasan.

10
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Piştî heşt-neh salan vegeriyan gundê xwe,
 
After eight or nine years, they returned to their village,

11
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:43,000
lê me jî xwest bi hezkirin û bi çîçak,
 
and we also wanted with love and flowers,

12
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:48,000
û bi evîn em derbasî cem wan bin, vê zarokê dengê xwe xweş,
û vê keçikê dengê xwe xweş.
 
and with affection to visit them, this boy with his
beautiful voice, and this girl with her beautiful voice.

13
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Van zarokên ez gava derbasî cem wan bûm, li ser pir û gelek
vîdyoyên wan dinêrîm, belav dibin, bi mîlyonan wan kes
muşahade dikin, wan kes li wan sêr dikin.
 
When I visited these children, I had watched many of their
videos, which have been going viral, with millions of people
watching them.

14
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Lê îro jî me xwest em derbasî cem wan bibin, ji nêzîk va wan
nas bikin.
 
So today we wanted to visit them, to get to know them up
close.

15
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Temaşevanên me yê hêja, beriya vê bi du rojan min sûretek
dît li ser facebookê,
 
Our dear viewers, two days ago I saw a picture on Facebook,

16
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:11,000
