çîçakan...
 
I saw his grave, and they had gone to visit him, with
flowers...

18
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:21,000
Ez bi dîtina wî sûretî min di dilê xwe da... min hinekî di
nav xwe da fikirî,
 
Upon seeing that picture, I felt in my heart... I thought to
myself for a moment,

19
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:25,000
