00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:08,000
Û hatin Efrîn, qenela Hatim Efrîn jî îro derbasî cem wan bû.
 
And they came to Afrin, and Hatim Afrin's channel came to
visit them today.

25
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:11,000
