Ez gel wî wextê dinêrim, Ciwan Hesen jî dinêre.
 
When I look at him, he also looks like Ciwan Hesen.

302
00:20:15,000 --> 00:20:19,000
Belê mamoste, rehmî Ciwan Hesen.
 
Yes teacher, the late Ciwan Hesen.

303
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:23,000
Wextê ku ew guhdarî dikin wek Ciwan Hesen dibînin?
 
When they listen, do they see him like Ciwan Hesen?

304
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:30,000
