wî, hemî hunermend in, ez wî qezenc dikim yanî.
 
Yes, an example of him has remained in his place, I mean his
father, his cousin, are all artists, I benefit from him.

305
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:33,000
Yanî, me gelek pesnê te dida, yanî.
 
I mean, we praised you a lot.

306
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:38,000
Yanî wextê mirî ye, ev pir ber dila ketiye.
 
I mean when he died, he was very heartbroken.

307
00:20:38,000 --> 00:20:43,000
