hawil dida...
 
Yes. We were all heartbroken. Now, in the introduction of
the video I was trying...

308
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:48,000
Çima di xweşiyê da em narin ser hevd e, em kilameka hevra
nabên.
 
Why don't we visit each other in good times, and not sing a
song together.

309
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:51,000
